This project is an unofficial fan recreation of the UA 571-C Remote Sentry
Weapon System operator console as depicted in the film Aliens (1986) and its
Special Edition. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to
20th Century Studios, The Walt Disney Company, Fox, James Cameron, or any
rights holders of the Alien franchise.

Inspiration and prior art
-------------------------

Behavior and panel layout were informed by the open-source GRiD-OS recreation:

  UA571C by Thom Cherryhomes (tschak909)
  https://github.com/tschak909/UA571C
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

Thank you to Thom for publishing UA571C and for work resurrecting GRiD
development tools. That recreation provided a concrete reference for layout
and operator-panel behavior beyond film stills alone. This project uses
GPL-3.0 at his preference so the license family matches UA571C.

This Rust project is a clean-room modernization: new source, new architecture,
and no GRiD-OS binaries or proprietary toolchains are distributed here.

The original film prop displays used GRiD Compass II hardware on set.
